<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page team-join-page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error && team}}"><view class="join-hero"><view class="join-hero-copy"><view class="join-kicker">给你的轻盈邀请</view><view class="join-heading">一个人走很快，<view>一起走得更远。</view></view><view class="join-subtitle">和伙伴一起坚持记录</view></view><view class="join-hero-glow"></view><image class="join-trophy" src="/images/home/shortcuts/rank.png" mode="aspectFit"/><image class="join-people" src="/images/home/shortcuts/team.png" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view class="join-card invitation-card"><view class="invitation-title">邀请好友加入小队</view><view class="invitation-copy">邀请码生成后 7 天内有效，可供多位同城好友使用，直到小队满员。</view><view wx:if="{{code}}" class="invitation-code-box"><view class="invitation-code">{{code}}</view><view class="invitation-expiry">有效至 {{expires}} 00:00</view></view><view wx:if="{{!team.isCaptain}}" class="notice mt">请联系队长生成好友邀请码。</view><view wx:if="{{team.isCaptain && !inviteAvailable}}" class="notice mt">小队已结束或已解散，无法继续邀请。</view><view class="invitation-actions"><button class="invite-generate" bindtap="generate" disabled="{{busy || !inviteAvailable}}">生成好友邀请码</button><button class="invite-poster" bindtap="poster" disabled="{{busy || !inviteAvailable}}">生成募集海报</button><button class="invite-copy" bindtap="copy" disabled="{{!code}}">复制邀请码</button><button class="invite-wechat" open-type="share" disabled="{{!code}}">邀请微信好友一起</button></view></view><button class="join-help" bindtap="rules">小队挑战怎么玩？再看一遍说明</button><view class="join-privacy">加入后展示昵称与小队整体完成率，不公开体重和餐食照片。</view><canvas canvas-id="teamInvitePoster" class="team-invite-canvas" style="width:300px;height:420px"/></block><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !team}}" class="card empty">暂无可邀请的小队</view><include src="../../components/team-rules-view.wxml"/></view>